@host = http://localhost:3000

### Verificação de saúde
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Consultar métricas do painel inicial
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard

### Buscar todas as faturas
GET {{host}}/api/invoices

### Buscar fatura por identificador 
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/1

### Buscar fatura por identificador inválido
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/abc

### Buscar fatura por identificador inexistente
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/999999

### Buscar uma fatura pelo identificador
GET {{host}}/api/invoices/1

### Criar fatura
POST {{host}}/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
"customerId": 1,
"amount": 125037,
"status": "pending",
"issueDate": "2026-10-01",
"dueDate": "2026-10-31"
}


### Alterar fatura 
PUT {{host}}/api/invoices/181
Content-Type: application/json

{
"customerId": 1,
"amount": 125037,
"status": "paid",
"issueDate": "2026-10-01",
"dueDate": "2026-10-31"
}

### DELETAR FATURA

DELETE {{host}}/api/invoices/181